rfc3454.txt
    RFC 3454, "Preparation of Internationalized Strings ("stringprep")", https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3454.txt,
    downloaded on 2026-10-25.
    License: IETF Trust Legal Provisions; the tables are data.
    Format: the text of the RFC; tools/stringprep_tables.py reads the tables of appendices A to D.
    Used: every table (generated into src/codec/stringprep/tables.rs), and the tests compare entries with it.

rfc4013.txt
    RFC 4013, "SASLprep: Stringprep Profile for User Names and Passwords",
    https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4013.txt, downloaded on 2026-10-25.
    License: IETF Trust Legal Provisions; the examples are data.
    Format: the text of the RFC.
    Used: the profile of section 2 and the examples of section 3.

rfc4518.txt
    RFC 4518, "Lightweight Directory Access Protocol (LDAP): Internationalized String Preparation",
    https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4518.txt, downloaded on 2026-10-25, with its verified errata 860, 1757 and 1758
    (https://www.rfc-editor.org/errata/rfc4518).
    License: IETF Trust Legal Provisions.
    Format: the text of the RFC.
    Used: the six steps of section 2, which the tests check rule by rule.

UnicodeData-3.2.0.txt, CompositionExclusions-3.2.0.txt, NormalizationTest-3.2.0.txt
    The Unicode Character Database of Unicode 3.2.0, https://www.unicode.org/Public/3.2-Update/ (the files of the same
    names), downloaded on 2026-10-25.
    License: Unicode License v3 (LICENSE-UNICODE.txt).
    Format: the formats of the Unicode Character Database (UAX #44 and the headers of the files).
    Used: tools/stringprep_tables.py generates the combining classes, decompositions, compositions and combining
    marks from UnicodeData-3.2.0.txt and CompositionExclusions-3.2.0.txt; the tests run every line of
    NormalizationTest-3.2.0.txt (parts 0 to 3) and check that every code point not listed in part 1 is unchanged by
    every form.
